# Frontend Implementation Plan

The goal is to create a modern, vibrant Next.js frontend with Login, Register, and Logout functionality. The UI will feature sliding transitions between forms and a dedicated loading screen.

## Proposed Changes

### [Frontend Components]
The UI components will be stored in the root `frontend/components` directory to keep the design logic separate from the routing logic.

#### [NEW] [LoadingScreen.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/frontend/components/LoadingScreen.tsx)
- A full-screen animated loading overlay with vibrant gradients.
- Uses Framer Motion for smooth entry/exit animations.

#### [NEW] [AuthForm.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/frontend/components/AuthForm.tsx)
- A reusable form container that handles the "sliding overlay" effect.
- Will contain both Login and Register views.

#### [NEW] [LoginForm.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/frontend/components/LoginForm.tsx)
- The login form component.

#### [NEW] [RegisterForm.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/frontend/components/RegisterForm.tsx)
- The registration form component.

---

### [Next.js Pages]
The pages will be entry points in `src/app` that call the corresponding components.

#### [NEW] [login/page.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/login/page.tsx)
#### [NEW] [register/page.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/register/page.tsx)
#### [NEW] [logout/page.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/logout/page.tsx)

#### [MODIFY] [layout.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/Documents/proyecto_informatico_1/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/layout.tsx)
- Add global styles (vibrant gradients, typography).
- Include the `LoadingScreen` manager.

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- N/A (Manual verification via browser tool).

### Manual Verification
- Verify that navigating between `/login` and `/register` triggers the sliding overlay.
- Verify that form submissions correctly call the `/api/users/*` routes.
- Verify the loading screen appearance on page transitions.
